<title>NORWAY: Norway's March foreign trade surplus NOK 9.17 bln.</title>
<headline>Norway's March foreign trade surplus NOK 9.17 bln.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator. Figures (billions of crowns, excludes shipping and oil platforms)</p>
<p> NORWAY'S FOREIGN TRADE	MARCH 1997   FEB 1997    MARCH 1996</p>
<p> Imports			    17.66	 17.14	  18.87</p>
<p> Exports			    26.82	 25.91	  26.29</p>
<p> Balance			     9.17	  8.78	   7.42</p>
<p> Excluding oil/gas		-5.62	 -4.41	  -4.91</p>
<p>--Rolf Soderlind, Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
